It's Duarte.

52
00:01:43,876 --> 00:01:45,731
His plan is to join all of

53
00:01:45,751 --> 00:01:47,706
humanity into one mind,

54
00:01:47,726 --> 00:01:50,031
strong enough to fight the beings outside

55
00:01:50,051 --> 00:01:51,031
